{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chosen Garden (\u5929\u9009\u82b1\u56ed / \u5929\u9078\u82b1\u5712 ) is a cozy roguelike deck-builder with a gardening twist! Cultivate unique garden and aim for victory before your harvests run out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand, Harvest, and Replant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a 3\u00d73 plot and expand your garden tile by tile. Harvest and replant strategically to maximize your yield and maintain the powerful combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/ee2f507077437d589ece2451e3c2fbfe.poster.avif?t=1764318707\" width=598 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/ee2f507077437d589ece2451e3c2fbfe.webm?t=1764318707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/ee2f507077437d589ece2451e3c2fbfe.mp4?t=1764318707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With endless combinations, no two runs are ever the same! Place over 100 plants, adapt to shifting weather, and bloom your strategy across diverse garden layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/42d6886cb803369d46c48e6a0b0bc5a9.poster.avif?t=1764318707\" width=598 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/42d6886cb803369d46c48e6a0b0bc5a9.webm?t=1764318707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/42d6886cb803369d46c48e6a0b0bc5a9.mp4?t=1764318707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft the Ultimate Garden Build</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unique plants with special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 upgrade paths to specialize plant traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 fertilizers to boost growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 animals with bonus powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 weather effects offering buffs and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 tools for run-wide bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 distinct gardens,  with unique tiles and special plants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/d791f35b447a83a4aa03f29cd8a83f49.poster.avif?t=1764318707\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/d791f35b447a83a4aa03f29cd8a83f49.webm?t=1764318707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923750/extras/d791f35b447a83a4aa03f29cd8a83f49.mp4?t=1764318707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Gardening Adventure for Everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to  tunes, charming hand-drawn visuals, and smooth animations as you cultivate your dream garden. Watch your creation thrive, or refine your strategy for the perfect run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/